{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13204090","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13204090","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1320409001:0":{"text":"おお、どうだ？利益の二割をワシの取り分としてくれるなら、ビジネスパートナーとして何でも相談に乗るぞ！","source_cn":"熊妹子，你考虑得怎么样？只要让我入伙白熊旅店，拿两成利...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E5B19479C542146","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320409002:0":{"text":"それじゃ、こっちも回りくどいことはなしだ。ウチが心血注いだ旅館事業に、易々と他人を参入させるわけにはいかない。","source_cn":"实话实说吧，矮人兄弟，白熊旅店是我的心血，让你入伙不太可能。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4442252B4A510512","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320409003:0":{"text":"その代わり、他の従業員みたいに毎年アンタにボーナスを払う形でなら考えてもいいべ。","source_cn":"不过呢，我可以答应让你和旅店里的其他员工一样，每年拿一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x179AA0A8A3B8F51A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320409004:0":{"text":"従業員ボーナスか……毎年いくらもらえるんだ？","source_cn":"员工分红……那每年能拿到多少？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76E6734D1DB9CE52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320409005:0":{"text":"職人として協力してもらうんだ……純利益の一割でどうだい？\nあ、これは他の従業員には内緒だべ。","source_cn":"看在你是工匠的份上，我可以给到净利润的一成。\\n——不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C0F2748D6397765","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_re